==English==

===Alternative spellings===
* [[tartar sauce]] ''([[US]]: mayo + relish)''

===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[tartare]] [[sauce]]}}

# A [[sauce]] made from [[mayonnaise]] and a [[chopped]] [[mixture]] of [[pickled]] [[gherkin]]s, [[caper]]s, [[olive]]s and [[shallot]]s; traditionally served with [[fish]] or other [[seafood]].

